        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161916643?u=ac460ddbb1c07a3453efc41c8bbb87d21b4878a5&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This PR updates the interactive example for the </p> element.<br>
